he quadratic split (#449)\n4368a7c0 fix(tooling): gate the seven ungated test suites, stop the mirror-out digest false-red, fix the pre-commit no-target false-red (#450)\n62e260ac fix(state): correct the build-state ceiling, gate it, surface the two parked forks, record the #452 ride (#451)\nf6282dc3 feat(site): correct the sameAs identity claim, crawl hygiene, and the llms.txt open-core split (#452)\n1bc9988e docs(agents): GridWork fleet graph rails (CLAUDE.md, serves AGENTS.md symlink)\nd2d1a47b docs(deploy): record the analytics origin-gate ride\n8b1ab7ca fix(site): gate client analytics on the production origin (#447)\n8b14fbb3 docs(state): record the first automated docs + support-bot ride\ncb33fdd7 feat(tooling): automate the docs + support-bot deploys, promote the Python gate to required (ADR-0414) (#446)\nc40d02d5 chore(tooling): fold browser-audit into its skill + derive the visual-harness routes (ADR-0407 C13/C25) (#445)\n5c64009c docs(site): name @caisson/ds-manifest publicly — the open-Base census is sixteen (ADR-0412) (#444)\nb0d6227d docs(deploy): leg 4 landed at the tag, fleet brought to one revision on main\naee4285e docs(state): stamp probe-accounts freshness - the #443 cascade tail\nca240e04 chore(scaffold): add .graphifyignore - keep the code-graph indexer off archived ledgers\n1ca11b8e chore(tooling): retire design-critic — archive the ledger, add the D8 visual dimension (ADR-0411) (#443)\ndc770168 chore(registry): retire @caisson/analytics — delete + module-delist (ADR-0410) (#442)\n78399d80 docs(state): record the v2026.08.18 train - four legs landed, leg 4 blocked on a Railway incident\n7128ea74 fix(tooling): repair the two leg-2 mirror-gate breaks the v2026.08.18 train exposed\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
