imestamp precedes deployment creation and is not an app-start/SUCCESS timestamp.\noutputs/audit/release-train-2026-09-receipt.md:340:License health at response Date `2026-09-14T14:29:21Z`: HTTP 200, exact `x-caisson-revision` above, `ok: true`, index digest `8835d704a8c7`, 52 entries. Before requests, the prediction was restated: all unsigned arms HTTP 401; A key `issue|2600:1702:7e60:3c0::31`, B key `issue|45.17.0.122`, unchanged by forged IP headers. The September 14 preflight had freshly confirmed both ingress addresses before any application probe.\noutputs/audit/release-train-2026-09-receipt.md:344:| License A normal, IPv6 | `92c71b83-737c-493b-b87d-e3c470e0075a` | 2026-09-14 14:29:29 | 401                | 401, `unauthorized`; exact serving revision; Railway request `fOrScSP2RJKFd21Wjq4OvQ`, application request `24f5ecf8-9cd0-4b1f-8a7f-c9c41e8ed22d`, CF ray `a3b0158d18aa7515-ATL` |\noutputs/audit/release-train-2026-09-receipt.md:345:| License A forged, IPv6 | `4747a030-572b-4e80-b82f-693c074525d3` | 2026-09-14 14:29:38 | 401                | **403**, text `error code: 1000`, server Cloudflare, CF ray `a3b015c098a40779-ATL`; no revision, Railway request ID or application request ID in this response                   |\noutputs/audit/release-train-2026-09-receipt.md:347:| License B forged, IPv4 | `d22df131-3dd4-4fd8-ac7b-c9397bb8f1da` | —                   | 401                | NOT SENT after stop                                                                                                                                                              |\noutputs/audit/release-train-2026-09-receipt.md:349:| Site A forged          | `4747a030-572b-4e80-b82f-693c074525d3` | —                   | 403                | NOT SENT                                                                                                                                                                         |\noutputs/audit/release-train-2026-09-receipt.md:351:| Site B forged      