{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_83","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc 'nl -ba apps/site/lib/session-hint-cookie.ts'","aggregated_output":"     1\t// The name of the server-minted, HttpOnly session-HINT cookie (ADR-0418). Split into its own\n     2\t// zero-dependency module so `app/api/cart/owned/route.ts` (which reads the cookie directly via\n     3\t// `cookies()` to short-circuit before resolving a session) doesn't have to import `auth-server.ts`\n     4\t// — which mints/clears the cookie via `sessionHintCookieHook` — just for one string literal:\n     5\t// `auth-server.ts` pulls in `pg` + the full `better-auth` server SDK.\n     6\texport const SESSION_HINT_COOKIE_NAME = \"caisson_sess_hint\";\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
